        ]
      ],
      "id": "9sy67nh"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "q0s1y7f",
      "content": "• Third layer of the atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yrkqtwj",
      "content": "• Meteors burn up due to friction in this layer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cmm8cgk",
      "content": "• It is the coldest layer."
    },
    {
      "id": "tifqaki",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Thermosphere"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hhrhj8c",
      "content": "• Temperature rises sharply with height."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fh2qnac",
      "content": "• Contains ionized gases forming the ionosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vagt5cu",
      "content": "• Important for radio communication."
    },
    {
      "id": "fi129f0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Exosphere"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f3nhn6p",
      "content": "• Outermost layer of the atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2ccci4r",
      "content": "• Gradually merges into outer space."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Ozone layer is located in the Stratosphere, protecting life from UV radiation.",
        "All weather phenomena (clouds, rainfall, fog) occur exclusively in the Troposphere.",
        "Radio wave reflection occurs in the Ionosphere, which forms part of the Thermosphere.",
        "Temperature decreases at a normal lapse rate of 6.5°C per 1,000 meters in the Troposphere."
      ],
      "id": "mcnfrfn"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k6e36eq",
      "content": "• Contains very thin air."
    },
    {
      "id": "85qhw3t",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "38q4y5i",
      "content": "• Nitrogen is the most abundant gas in the atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ye51e72",
      "content": "• Ozone layer is located in the stratosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "znd2jv3",
      "content": "• Troposphere contains most weather phenomena."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2w2axpm",
      "content": "• Mesosphere is the coldest layer."
    }
  ],
